$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=tmccmrd  LOC_AFTER=?

* The read phase of the comparator at the machine (Lean ` OpA.read ` then ` OpB.read ` ): on the class of iteration ` i ` the flags say whether ` i ` is past each read set, and the two reads lead into the post-read class (~ tmcadrd with ` cmp ` in place of ` carry ` ).

